{
  "id": "E250",
  "title": "Buying Headphones Online",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-08-25",
  "synopsis": "Little Le wants to buy a new pair of headphones. Paul gives her some suggestions.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/821/08e463e3b05ee84478c702f5f9a88e027d89d2d1.mp3?1534163005",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "在网上买耳机\n\n保罗：小乐，你去哪儿？\n小乐：我去商店买一个耳机。我的旧耳机坏了。\n保罗：外面太热了，你要不要在网上买耳机，就不用出门了。\n小乐：但是我不知道他们的耳机怎么样。\n保罗：没关系，我知道一个很好的网店。你不喜欢还可以退货。\n小乐：好，你可以把链接发给我吗？我在网上买。",
    "traditional": "在網上買耳機\n\n保羅：小樂，你去哪兒？\n小樂：我去商店買一個耳機。我的舊耳機壞了。\n保羅：外面太熱了，你要不要在網上買耳機，就不用出門了。\n小樂：但是我不知道他們的耳機怎麼樣。\n保羅：沒關係，我知道一個很好的網店。你不喜歡還可以退貨。\n小樂：好，你可以把鏈接發給我嗎？我在網上買。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Buying Headphones Online"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：小乐，你去哪儿？",
      "traditional": "保羅：小樂，你去哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiǎo lè nǐ qù nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Little Le, where are you going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：我去商店买一个耳机。我的旧耳机坏了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我去商店買一個耳機。我的舊耳機壞了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ qù shāng diàn mǎi yí ge ěr jī wǒ de jiù ěr jī huài le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I’m going to the store to buy a pair of headphones. My old ones broke."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：外面太热了，你要不要在网上买耳机，就不用出门了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：外面太熱了，你要不要在網上買耳機，就不用出門了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wài miàn tài rè le nǐ yào bú yào zài wǎng shang mǎi ěr jī jiù bú yòng chū mén le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s too hot outside. Do you want to buy headphones online? Then you don’t have to go outside."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：但是我不知道他们的耳机怎么样。",
      "traditional": "小樂：但是我不知道他們的耳機怎麼樣。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè dàn shì wǒ bù zhī dào tā men de ěr jī zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: But I don’t know what their headphones are like."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：没关系，我知道一个很好的网店。你不喜欢还可以退货。",
      "traditional": "保羅：沒關係，我知道一個很好的網店。你不喜歡還可以退貨。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó méi guān xi wǒ zhī dào yí ge hěn hǎo de wǎng diàn nǐ bù xǐ huan hái kě yǐ tuì huò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It doesn’t matter. I know a good online shop. If you’re not satisfied, you can return them."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：好，你可以把链接发给我吗？我在网上买。",
      "traditional": "小樂：好，你可以把鏈接發給我嗎？我在網上買。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hǎo nǐ kě yǐ bǎ liàn jiē fā gěi wǒ ma wǒ zài wǎng shang mǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Ok. Could you send the link to me? I’ll buy a pair online."
    }
  ],
